<title>USA: Parkvale board sets share buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Parkvale board sets share buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>MONROEVILLE, Pa. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parkvale Financial Corp said Thursday its directors authorized the repurchase of up to 202,500 shares, representing five percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The company said repurchases would take place in open-market transactions during the fiscal year ending June 30, 1998. Repurchased shares would be available for general corporate purposes, primarily contributions to employee benefit plans, it said.</p>
<p>This program replaces one expiring July 15, which resulted in the acquisition of about 1.4 percent of Parkvale's shares.</p>
</text>
